%[text] %[text:anchor:T_A0E399BA] # Applied Linear Algebra
%[text:tableOfContents]{"heading":"Table of Contents"}
%[text] %[text:anchor:H_BDDB548D] ## Scripts
%[text] %[text:anchor:H_660DA8CF] ### [BalancingChemicalEquations](file:./Scripts/BalancingChemicalEquations.m)
%[text:table]{"columnWidths":[-1,345,-1]}
%[text] | Chemical reactions | **In this script, students will...** | **Academic disciplines** |
%[text] | --- | --- | --- |
%[text] | ![A matrix stoichiometric equation](text:image:4bf1) | <p>• build and solve matrix equations</p><p>• identify the rank and null spaces of matrices</p><p>• balance chemical reactions</p> | <p>• Chemistry</p><p>• Mathematics</p> |
%[text:table]
%[text] %[text:anchor:H_FF5FC4FF] ### [MarkovModeling](file:./Scripts/MarkovModeling.m)
%[text:table]{"columnWidths":[-1,336,172]}
%[text] | Zombie outbreak | **In this script, students will...** | **Academic disciplines** |
%[text] | --- | --- | --- |
%[text] | ![SIZ complete directed graph](text:image:3fa3) | <p>• compute powers of transition matrices</p><p>• compute eigenvalues and eigenvectors and explain their meaning in a modeling context</p><p>• create a model of a zombie outbreak</p><p>• analyze real-world scenarios for mayflies and HIV</p> | <p>• Biology</p><p>• Mathematics</p> |
%[text:table]
%[text] %[text:anchor:H_1EF6C345] ### [Steganography](file:./Scripts/Steganography.m)
%[text:table]{"columnWidths":[-1,337,171]}
%[text] | Image encryption | **In this script, students will...** | **Academic disciplines** |
%[text] | --- | --- | --- |
%[text] | ![An image hidden in storms; Original image credit: NASA, Caltech, SwRI, ASI, INAF, JIRAM](text:image:7d66) | <p>• use matrix arithmetic</p><p>• represent images and text as matrices</p><p>• encrypt images inside other images</p> | <p>• Computer Science</p><p>• Mathematics</p> |
%[text:table]
%[text] %[text:anchor:H_BA53A051] ### [StaticForces](file:./Scripts/StaticForces.m) and [Moments](file:./Scripts/Moments.m)
%[text:table]{"columnWidths":[-1,335,-1]}
%[text] | Static force analysis | **In these scripts, students will...** | **Academic disciplines** |
%[text] | --- | --- | --- |
%[text] | ![Static forces on an open trap door](text:image:5f6f) | <p>• define and normalize vectors</p><p>• build and solve matrix equations</p><p>• calculate dot products and cross products</p><p>• solve for moments, tensions, and forces</p> | <p>• Civil Engineering</p><p>• Mechanical Engineering</p><p>• Mathematics</p> |
%[text:table]
%[text] %[text:anchor:H_3200260D] ### [Identify Digits](file:./Scripts/IdentifyDigits.m) and [ReadMyWriting](file:./Scripts/ReadMyWriting.m)
%[text:table]{"columnWidths":[-1,338,168]}
%[text] | Machine learning | **In these scripts, students will...** | **Academic disciplines** |
%[text] | --- | --- | --- |
%[text] | ![Confusion chart showing 89% accuracy](text:image:7db8) | <p>• use singular value decomposition and distance</p><p>• use binary morphology tools to preprocess image data</p><p>• create a tool that will identify handwritten digits</p> | <p>• Computer Science</p><p>• Mathematics</p> |
%[text:table]
%[text] %[text:anchor:H_2CA1A553] ### [Robotics](file:./Scripts/Robotics.m)
%[text:table]{"columnWidths":[-1,335,173],"ignoreHeader":true}
%[text] | Robotic manipulators | **In this script, students will...** | **Academic disciplines** |
%[text] | --- | --- | --- |
%[text] | ![A three-link robotic arm](text:image:097d) | <p>• compute the Cartesian result of a sum of polar vectors</p><p>• explore the concept of a configuration space through visualizations</p><p>• explain the connection between degrees of freedom, multiplicity of solutions, and the null space</p> | <p>• Mechanical engineering</p><p>• Mathematics</p> |
%[text:table]
%[text] 
